		"description": "<p>The urge to fight runs hot in your veins and you take to battle naturally. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Speed increases by 5 feet.</p></li><li><p>When making an Acrobatics or Athletics check during combat, you can choose to use your Strength or Dexterity modifier for either skill.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with the @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-maneuvers.Item.ad0iup2ueg5p4fui]{Bounding Strike} maneuver and do not have to spend exertion to activate it.</p></li><li><p>You can roll 1d4 in place of your normal damage for unarmed strikes. When rolling damage for your unarmed strikes, you can choose to deal bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing damage.</p></li></ul>",
